<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan July wholesale price index down 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Moroccan July wholesale price index down 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's wholesale price index dropped 0.4 percent in July to 360.9 points from 362.3 points in the previous month, the Statistics Directorate said.</p>
<p>The index rose 3.6 percent in July from a year ago, it said.</p>
<p>The average index for the first seven months in 1996 rose 6.5 percent compared with the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The directorate gave the following figures:</p>
<p>Pct change:</p>
<p>				 Yr/Yr		month/month</p>
<p>    July			6.5		   -0.4</p>
<p>    June			7.1		   -1.4</p>
<p>Note: figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
